# ==========================================
# Anlogic EG4S20 FPGA Project .gitignore
# ==========================================

# 1. 忽略大型网盘安装包与原厂全套软件镜像（避免超出 GitHub 100MB 限制）
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
*.tar.gz
*.iso
HX4S20_Contest_202606/
HX4S20_Contest_202606.zip

# 2. 忽略第三方软件安装包与冗余数据转储
*.exe
*.msi
*.dll
xin.txt

# 3. 忽略安路 TangDynasty (TD) 编译临时数据库与过程文件
*.db
*.ts
*.area
*.timing
*.qor
*.logw
*.rpt
*.f
*.cwc
*.qws
*.qdf
*.ppf
*.qip
*.ipregen.rpt
*.nativelink_simulation.rpt
gate_flow.status
flow.status
camera_to_dsi_display_Runs/
*_Runs/
run/
log/
.temp.f
.opt_*.f
.read_design.*.f

# 4. 忽略 ModelSim 仿真缓存与波形文件
work/
transcript
*.wlf
modelsim.ini

# 5. 忽略操作系统与编辑器临时文件
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.bak
*.orig
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# 6. 必须保留的关键文件白名单（无论何时不被忽略）
!*.v
!*.vhd
!*.sv
!*.h
!*.adc
!*.sdc
!*.al
!*.ipc
!*.do
!*.tcl
!*.bmp
!*.wav
!*.bit
!README.md
!.gitignore
